---
source: tests/scaffold_recipe.rs
expression: text
---
--- create meta-mine:recipes-app/widget/widget_1.2.bb
SUMMARY = "widget"
LICENSE = "MIT"
# sous-chef: supply LIC_FILES_CHKSUM, e.g. "file://LICENSE;md5=<md5sum of the file>"

SRC_URI = "git://github.com/example/widget.git;protocol=https;branch=dev;destsuffix=${BP}"
# sous-chef: supply SRCREV, the commit to build

inherit cmake
note: SUMMARY defaults to the recipe name; describe the recipe (option `summary`)
note: supply LIC_FILES_CHKSUM (option `lic_files_chksum`): the license file(s) in the source and their md5sum
note: the git source unpacks into ${BP} (destsuffix=${BP}), so the default S works on every release from kirkstone to wrynose; from whinlatter that is the git fetcher's default and the parameter can be dropped
note: supply SRCREV (option `srcrev`): the full commit id to build
note: class cmake was not found in the indexed layers; it is the OE-core name, so the layer needs OE-core (or the layer that provides it) in BBLAYERS
